    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "此現米二百七十石八斗七升七合　但石八兩立"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "この現米（げんまい）二百七十石八斗七升七合　但し石（こく）八両立て"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "This in current rice: 270.877 koku, reckoned at eight ryo to the koku (但石八兩立). The figure is the eiraku-cash total of the column to the right converted at the stated rate: 2,167 kan 17 mon is 2,167.017, and 2,167.017 divided by 8 is 270.8771, printed here as 270.877."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "此現米"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p188_left.jpg",
