      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "House stipend: 1,112.6421 koku, printed as one tenth of the 11,126.421 koku combined total. The head of the column is a double-column warichu in small type — the right line reads 此十分, the left line 一家祿, so the two lines run together as 此十分一・家祿 — and the value follows in full-size type. 11,126.421 divided by 10 is 1,112.6421 exactly."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "一家祿"
